  //    researched alongside these and stays UNSEEDED: its "Custom Servers"
  //    feature is a rental subscription running on NetEase/Starry Studio's own
  //    infrastructure, not a downloadable dedicated-server binary — no
  //    self-hostable option exists at all (confirmed via official NetEase
